  <History Date="01-05-09" Author="David Hunt" Comment="Checked" />
  <History Date="30-06-09" Author="David Hunt" Comment="Changed Locate values of shutter and shutter func" />
  <History Date="20-07-09" Author="David Hunt" Comment="Fixed dimmer in shutter not being assigned to fader" />
  <History Date="30-04-10" Author="John Rogers" Comment="Fixed broken Macros in both v1.2 modes. Added Red to Colour, Fixed_Func." />
  <History Date="19-04-12" Author="Locate Fix" Comment="Updated locate, power on, highlight and lowlight values to valid values" />
  <History Date="19-04-13" Author="RDM Sync Tool" Comment="Added RDM Manufacturer information." />
  <History Date="27-10-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed name from SCX 700 to Mania SCX 700.  Revised mode names.  Added Atlabase ID's." />
  <History Date="27-10-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Standardised conditionals.  Fixed duplicate functions in else conditions.  Fixed shutter func updates." />
  <History Date="27-10-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Recreated palettes." />
  <History Date="28-10-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed gobo func update" />
